5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think we should look at what's actually happening on the floor. Maybe the incident logs or time lost?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"Let's not forget the humans behind the machines, Daisuke! I want to know who is actually doing the work.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"How optimistic. I'd prefer to see why our ""guaranteed"" dates always slip. Let's look at the actual constraints.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We need to be careful. It is not just about the initial cost, but where the money comes from and the long-term impact.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm excited! But wait, do we know if the old projects actually worked? I want to see what happened to them!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I just feel like we often ignore the small, daily mistakes. They add up, right?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,Exactly! But my worry is that we just throw more work at the same tired people. We need to check the staffing.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, staffing is a variable, but external access is a constant risk. I'm looking into the customer plant coverage.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, that is a technical risk. I am more concerned with the financial structure. I will check the budget and licenses.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Ryuji, that sounds boring! I want to know why some projects disappear after a year. Let's look at the rollouts!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I'll be the one to keep us honest about the workload. I'm definitely checking the coordination group's staffing.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll also check the vendor pricing. It's always the ""hidden costs"" that make us look incompetent during the rollout.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I agree on the hidden costs. I will investigate the software allowance to see if we have any actual room to move.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm going to look at the standardization efforts too! Maybe that's why some things fail and others stay.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
